===Etymology===
Originated in [[Jamaican Vernacular English]], perhaps originally short for ''[[disrespect]]'' or ''[[disparage]]''.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|diss|es}}

# {{context|US|British|slang}} to put (someone) down, or show [[disrespect]] by the use of [[insulting]] [[language]] or [[dismissive]] [[behaviour]]

